      "lines": [
        "Use the clues to fill the picture"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 251,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 536,
        "y": 379
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "Each number is a run of filled squares in its",
        "row or column. Separate runs with at least",
        "one empty square. A zero means the entire",
        "line is empty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 519,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 256,
      "centre": {
        "x": 536,
        "y": 647
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "Tap a square to cycle blank, filled and",
        "crossed out. The outlined square is your",
        "last choice. A cross means you have",
        "decided the square is empty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 787,
      "width": 978,
      "height": 192,
      "centre": {
        "x": 536,
        "y": 883
      },
      "action": 3440364824,
      "lines": [
        "Clues sit beside their matching lines. Tap a",
        "clue to read its complete sequence. An",
        "ellipsis means there are more numbers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "Text",
      "x": 47,
